  "description": "And a quick Substack Tutorial",
  "body_html": "<p>👋 Welcome to StockTok! A survey was conducted to figure out what the improvements to StockTok Substack was. The 2 primary improvements:</p><ul><li><p>Longer Term Investments</p></li><li><p>How to navigate Substack…Where is everything?</p></li></ul><p>To Prevent having too many documents, the Long Term Stock picks will be in <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Screener</a>, and be labeled “long term”. This screener operates on the Weekly and Monthly timeframes, more suitable for those with busy schedules. Have not decided whether I want to update every 2 weeks or every month. What do you think?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hU3x!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e913fb6-5383-4706-a372-4f54ff7c2129_642x352.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hU3x!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e913fb6-5383-4706-a372-4f54ff7c2129_642x352.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hU3x!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e913fb6-5383-4706-a372-4f54ff7c2129_642x352.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hU3x!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e913fb6-5383-4706-a372-4f54ff7c2129_642x352.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hU3x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e913fb6-5383-4706-a372-4f54